The journey:

Step sequence:
1. Seek #open-help (likely button)
2. Press Enter -> opens help panel (#help)
3. Press Tab -> expects focus on #help-close (close button)
But observed: After pressing Tab second time (the third step?), actually steps: Let's parse frozen_journey_requirements:

